<title>USA: TABLE - Heartland Partners Lp Q2 loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Heartland Partners Lp Q2 loss.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>(amounts in thousands, except per unit data)</p>
<p>			    (unaudited)</p>
<p>				Consolidated Operations</p>
<p>				     Quarter Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>			   Jun 30,     Jun 30,   Jun 30,    Jun 30,</p>
<p>				1997	  1996	1997	 1996</p>
<p> Total net revenues     $634	$1,141    $1,116     $1,631</p>
<p> Total expenses	  1,923	 1,635     3,652	3,156</p>
<p>	Net loss	 (1,289)	 (494)   (2,536)    (1,525)</p>
<p>Net loss per</p>
