<p>			     Consolidated Balance Sheet</p>
<p>				 Jun 30, 1997		Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p> Properties, net		  $22,613		     $21,051</p>
<p> Cash and all other assets	2,076			 6,989</p>
<p>	Total Assets		 24,689			28,040</p>
<p>	Total Liabilities (b)     7,938			 8,755</p>
<p>	Partner's Equity (c)     16,751			19,285</p>
<p>    (a)    Net income (loss) per Class A Unit is compiled by</p>
<p>dividing net income (loss), after deducting the General Partner's return and the return of the Class B Interest, by 2,142,438 Class A Units outstanding.</p>
<p>    (b)    Total liabilities include an allowance for claims</p>
<p>totaling $2.26 million at June 30, 1997 and $2.66 million at December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>    (c)    Partner's equity included an Unrealized Holding</p>
<p>Loss on Marketable Securities of $2 thousand at December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>	  -- ((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
